          "line1": "<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"></span> ",
          "line2": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\" style=\"font-size: 21.0px; background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">“</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21.0px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">I’m very thankful for all of the people that were there that day when I went down.</span><span class=\"futura-bold\"> They saved me. I’m here because of them.</span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\" style=\"font-size: 21.0px; background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">”</span></span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>______________<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bennett</span><br>\r\n</span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Sudden cardiac arrest patient</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n",
